# The exact denial each document in hospedajedonlolo-identity-bypasses.yaml must produce.
# scripts/test-policy-fixtures.sh compares this whole set: a message that
# disappears is a weakened rule, a message that appears is an unreviewed
# denial. File-level rejection alone hides both. Twelve documents, one arm
# each, so neutering any single arm turns this red rather than leaving the
# file "rejected" by the others.
OCIRepository hospedajedonlolo-com/hospedajedonlolo-com-chart must select the exact reviewed immutable chart digest
OCIRepository hospedajedonlolo-com/hospedajedonlolo-com-chart must verify chart signatures against this site's exact keyless publisher identity
OCIRepository hospedajedonlolo-com/hospedajedonlolo-com-chart must pull the canonical published chart repository
HelmRelease hospedajedonlolo-com/hospedajedonlolo-com must stay suspended while its chart selection is pending
HelmRelease hospedajedonlolo-com values must contain exactly deploymentReady: true
HelmRelease hospedajedonlolo-com must use ServiceAccount helm-reconciler
ResourceQuota hospedajedonlolo-com/namespace-budget must be either the exact zero-Pod gate or a hash-bound reviewed namespace budget
NetworkPolicy hospedajedonlolo-com/hospedajedonlolo-com-egress must not grant site egress
Kustomization hospedajedonlolo-com-reconciler must use path ./kubernetes/websites/hospedajedonlolo-com
Kustomization hospedajedonlolo-com-reconciler must use ServiceAccount hospedajedonlolo-com-reconciler
Pod hospedajedonlolo-with-a-sibling-account must use only ServiceAccount hospedajedonlolo-com
Namespace hospedajedonlolo-com must set Pod Security enforce to restricted
